From 0868108f0e70fa8e8e34a663344eda879ef64fce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:51:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Sort events listing by clicking the table header

Paginator and Model::paginate accept an ORDER BY clause built from a closed list of columns and extra query params kept in the page links.
